OL,3,GNEWSAHospice cuts deprive people of
OL,4,Adignity - leaders
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a joint report, they say the
OL,7,Ffinancial position has become
OL,8,F"unsustainable" while demand for
OL,9,Fend-of-life care rises and
OL,10,Fcost-of-living pressures limit
OL,11,Fdonations to their fundraising efforts.
OL,13,FThe Humber and North Yorkshire
OL,14,FIntegrated Care Board (ICB) said it
OL,15,Fwould continue to talk with hospice
OL,16,Fleaders about funding.
